WEBVTT

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:52.320
Please wait, Diancie-sama!

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:20.000
Diancie-sama, it is time! Princess!

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.260
Hide-and-seek is so much fun!

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:30.416
Ssh! Not right now, everyone!

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:31.500
Diancie-sama!

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.320
I got caught.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:37.880
Do not "I got caught" me!

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.010
Princess, you said yourself that...

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.390
Majima, are you all right?

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.220
I am.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.570
This is not the time to laugh!

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.340
Princess!

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.480
Elder!

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:10.940
Di!

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:16.650
Diancie-sama,

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.300
you have an important mission.

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:22.960
You must not forget that!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:35.960
For a long time, that Sacred Diamond has provided
our country with great power and tranquility.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:45.000
However, unable to fight the passage of time, its life is
now ending and it is about to lose its sacred radiance.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.900
But it is shining so beautifully...

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:52.250
Worrying too much will
be bad for your health.

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:55.660
Please take this seriously!

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:56.930
All right, all right.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.260
Answering once will suffice!

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:00.920
All right.

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:07.540
If the Sacred Diamond is lost, our country
will go down the path of destruction.

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.330
You are exaggerating.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.000
I am not!

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:17.000
Diancie-sama, you are the only one
who can give birth to a Sacred Diamond!

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:22.880
Today is the day you
will show me your powers.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:26.700
I got it. I will do it.
I will do it, all right?

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.136
Not that I think I can do it.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.330
Princess!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:33.630
Yes.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.560
Keep it up!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.626
As I thought, I cannot do it.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.560
I am sure you will be able to!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.970
That is what you were
born to do, after all!

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:33.140
I am grateful that you have raised me.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.810
But I...

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.690
Xerneas...

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.120
Go meet it.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.790
"Xerneas"?

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.210
That's right.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:46.940
Years ago, while I was on a journey,

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:52.680
the terrifying Great Destruction occurred
in a place called the "Alearth Woods".

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:28.250
My life is getting absorbed...

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.280
It's over...

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:06.490
This is...

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:07.890
Fairy Aura.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:09.690
Oh.

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:21.230
It was thanks to Xerneas that I survived.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:30.850
If I meet this... uh...

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:32.670
Xerneas.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:38.550
Meet this "Xerneas" and receive the Fairy
Aura that will let me unleash my true power,

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:42.130
will I really be able to
create a Sacred Diamond?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:43.630
You will!

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:45.810
Believe in the Fairy Aura!

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:56.840
Then I will go.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.700
I have long wanted to
see the outside world.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:02.470
Please take this more seriously!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.060
All right, all right!

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:05.260
You answer...

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:07.540
Once, right?

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.040
All right!

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:33.650
Pocket Monsters, or "Pokémon" for short:

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:38.180
The strange, mysterious
lifeforms on this planet.

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:51.690
In the forests...

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:01.970
In the skies...

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:09.190
In the seas...

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:18.260
Wherever you are in the world,
you can be sure to see them.

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:23.630
Also...

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:29.150
Humans and Pokémon have bonded in many different
ways as they've lived together in this world.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.690
This boy, Satoshi of Masara Town,

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:16.260
battles and gets Pokémon
alongside his partner Pikachu.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:24.780
As a Pokémon Trainer, he continues his
travels in the pursuit of new knowledge.

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:29.960
There are as many dreams
as there are Pokémon.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:34.390
There are as many adventures
to be had as there are Pokémon.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:24.420
Mega Evolutions sure are powerful.

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:26.730
Heheh.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:33.580
Let's keep the Mega Absol lady!

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:34.030
Huh?

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.930
Have my big brother, s'il-vous-plaît!

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:41.000
Hey, Eureka! Your small act of
"kindness" is a big bother to me!

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.350
Think about it!

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:55.760
Pikachu!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:07.300
Riot.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.410
I won't let you get in my way.

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.120
I was about to say the same to you.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.750
Well then, I shall excuse myself.

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:15.680
No you won't!

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.270
Stop this! Two against
one, that's not fair!

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.980
And you call yourselves Pokémon Trainers?

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:32.030
Don't interfere.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:35.480
I have use for the diamonds
that little one can create.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.280
You speak too much, Marilyn.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.770
You're not a classy bandit,
you're a chatty bandit.

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:43.680
Bandit?

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:44.890
Run while you can.

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:49.880
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:57.950
Over here!
What the?

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.130
What's going on?

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:01.580
Should we call Junsa-san?

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:13.700
We should be fine now.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:18.076
Everyone, you have my
gratitude for saving me.

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:19.100
It talked.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:19.750
You're right!

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:20.930
It is telepathy.

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.230
How cute.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:23.790
I'm Satoshi.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:24.810
Satoshi.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.660
This is my partner, Pikachu.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:29.230
Pikachu.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:30.460
I'm Serena.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:31.380
Serena.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:32.860
I'm Eureka.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.270
Eureka.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:35.690
I am Citron.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:37.200
Citron.

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:39.540
This is a Pokémon, right?

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:42.100
Let's see...

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.940
So it's called "Diancie".

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:48.166
That bandit earlier mentioned it too, but it
looks like it has the ability to create diamonds.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.190
Diamonds?

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:51.090
So that is why they were after it.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.260
We came here in pursuit of Pikachu...

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.600
and found an incredible
Pokémon in the process.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.970
If we get that Pokémon...

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.870
Those people were bandits.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.750
What might such "bandits" be?

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:10.290
Bandits are people who take what's
precious to others without asking.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:12.910
They're bad people!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.780
So "bandits" are deplorable folks, then.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.990
I have learned a lot.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:37.190
Diancie...

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:38.520
These are great.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:41.530
Thank you very much.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.330
It is delicious.

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.990
Just help yourself; there's
no need for self-restraint!

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:55.060
It appears you have considerable appetite.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:56.330
Yeah.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.270
Eat much, sleep much.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.370
Those are the basics of good health.

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:06.210
I'm going to grab seconds.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:07.880
Diancie, wanna come along?

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:09.130
Oh... Yes.

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:13.190
Well then, I shall be going along with you.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:18.350
This way.

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:23.430
Diancie is so polite.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:25.770
She acts just like a
princess, don't you think?

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.290
You can say that again.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:30.540
There are so many different things.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:33.320
Yeah. Let's just grab a whole bunch!

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.250
Same here. Let's grab...

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:37.480
Grab...

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:38.990
Grab as we please!

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:46.120
Diamonds are minerals formed over hundreds of
millions of years and an extremely rare substance.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:51.090
They're very sturdy. They say
a diamond's shine lasts forever.

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:52.850
That's why they're so valuable.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.140
This one looks delicious.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:13.730
It's the Rocket Gang!

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:21.790
To think it'd be this easy
to get our hands on Diancie.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.490
What luck.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.830
You are also bandits, correct?

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:29.990
We're the Rocket Gang!

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:34.670
Bandits are those who would take what is
precious to others without asking, are they not?

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:36.500
Such is an evil act.

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:39.090
I have learned about this.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:42.466
And you'll be learning
a lot more from here on.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.626
All about the harsh realities of the world.

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:45.020
Yeah.

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:47.800
I am immensely grateful for that.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.340
However, I must be going back.

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:52.670
Well then, good day to you.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:54.690
Good day to you... Uh...

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:57.080
W-Wait, hold up!

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.420
Woah there.

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.030
We can't let you leave.

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:03.030
We've got some work you gotta do for us.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.150
I have never worked.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.450
You can create diamonds, right?

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:11.526
We've done our research, you know?

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:13.356
Make us some diamonds.

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:14.960
Some really sparkly ones.

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.930
So that was the kind of
work that you wanted done.

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:20.540
I could do that much for you.

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:21.860
Huh?

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:22.876
You will?

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:23.727
That was fast.

00:18:23.751 --> 00:18:26.076
How nice, you're surprisingly obedient.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.230
However, please do not be disappointed.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:32.026
Of course we won't. Come
on, give us some diamonds!

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:33.400
Carats, carats!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.020
Well then...

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.346
She did it!

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:49.370
Amazing!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.406
With just this single one, we can eat as much
Salisbury steak as we want for the rest of our lives!

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:55.430
We can eat as much tofu
fritters as we want, too!

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:58.260
We can even eat as much ice
cream as we want for dessert...

00:18:58.450 --> 00:18:59.890
Give us more!

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:01.270
Very well.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.446
So pretty!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:07.946
There's a second one!

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:09.796
With this, we can build a luxurious house!

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:11.866
And we can build a vacation
home with a hot spring!

00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:14.150
We can even buy a resort condo!

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.110
Come on, come on, more! Give us more!

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:25.070
Here they come!

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:33.460
It's a diamond bath!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.120
It might just cleanse my body... ow, ow!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.320
They hurt, but they feel so good!

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:04.460
Step back!

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:05.650
Huh?

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:15.140
Over here. Hurry.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:18.300
Look, she's over there!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.150
Diancie!

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:24.580
Are you okay?

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:26.656
You haven't been hurt
or anything, have you?

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.310
Nothing has happened to me.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:32.120
As soon as I made some
diamonds, I was allowed to go back.

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:36.650
I knew it, the Rocket Gang
wanted diamonds as well.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:39.500
It's good that you're safe, Diancie.

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:45.800
But right about now, I suppose
those bandits will be disappointed.

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.090
Huh?

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.590
Eh? Huh? Ah!

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:05.397
Nyah!?

00:21:05.421 --> 00:21:07.100
Huh? Wha? What, what, what!?

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:09.100
The diamonds are...!

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:10.870
No! Eh?

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:13.250
They disappeared!

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:23.660
I am still unable to exert my true power.

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:25.770
The diamonds you make disappear?

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:26.540
Yes.

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:29.380
That is why I am searching for Xerneas.

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:30.850
"Xerneas"?

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:32.660
It is a legendary Pokémon.

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:36.180
If I remember right, it is
said to be able to grant life.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:37.590
Wow.

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:40.120
It was explained to me
that Xerneas' Fairy Aura...

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:44.370
would bring out my true power.

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:46.930
It is because you are
also a Fairy-type, right?

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:48.690
Xerneas, huh?

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:50.756
I want to see it too!

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:51.780
Me too!

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:53.510
Here, here! Eureka too!

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:54.990
Of course, I do too.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.970
Diancie, could we go with you?

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:01.240
That would delight me as well.

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:07.150
Satoshi, everyone, I shall permit
you to accompany me on my journey.

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:10.040
Huh? Permit?

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:12.656
She really is a princess.

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.870
Huh? Diancie's a princess?

00:22:56.210 --> 00:23:00.420
If Diancie returns underground,
we won't be able to find it again.

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:05.560
Marilyn and Riot...

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:07.630
They're desperate for it too.

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:09.710
Gotta watch out for them.

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:11.680
Hm?

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.200
These people...

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:17.220
Hah! No need to bother with them!

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:25.020
Diancie's safe.

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:27.100
Good work, Miriss.

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:29.180
How about some chocolate?

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:31.826
Dad, aren't you eating too much of those?

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:34.530
They just came out with
a new mint chocolate.

00:23:35.210 --> 00:23:37.780
I ordered these all the
way from the Houen region.

00:23:38.530 --> 00:23:41.830
Besides, the cocoa that's used
in chocolate is good for you.

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:43.446
Cocoa contains...

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:46.570
I'm worried about your health, Dad!

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:48.360
I know that.

00:23:56.090 --> 00:23:57.090
Geez.

00:24:03.430 --> 00:24:04.430
Diancie...

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:07.340
Is Xerneas really going
to be in this direction?

00:24:08.910 --> 00:24:10.660
I do not lie.

00:24:11.110 --> 00:24:14.240
I was told that lying is
something that should not be done.

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:17.460
Then how do you know that it's this way?

00:24:18.940 --> 00:24:25.170
I am able to feel the traces of
Fairy Aura that Xerneas left behind.

00:24:36.550 --> 00:24:38.690
Xerneas will certainly be there.

00:24:39.810 --> 00:24:40.810
It will...

00:25:22.990 --> 00:25:25.000
I suppose it is futile.

00:25:31.590 --> 00:25:36.120
If you make a wish before a shooting star
disappears, it's said that it will come true.

00:25:37.300 --> 00:25:38.330
A wish?

00:25:38.760 --> 00:25:39.760
Yeah.

00:25:40.660 --> 00:25:42.350
I shall try.

00:25:43.430 --> 00:25:44.430
I'll join you.

00:25:48.450 --> 00:25:49.450
Now!

00:25:50.630 --> 00:25:56.130
I wish that Diancie will
be able to make diamonds.

00:26:35.550 --> 00:26:37.490
It is a group of Buoysel and Floasel!

00:26:38.040 --> 00:26:39.780
Ya-ho-hoi!

00:26:40.650 --> 00:26:42.980
Everyone, you all swim wonderfully.

00:27:02.140 --> 00:27:06.620
This is the most fun I have
had since I began my journey.

00:27:07.160 --> 00:27:09.670
That's because it's fun being with friends!

00:27:11.220 --> 00:27:13.630
What are "friends"?

00:27:14.030 --> 00:27:15.050
Friends are...

00:27:15.570 --> 00:27:16.950
They're friends. Right?

00:27:17.720 --> 00:27:21.550
They're fun companions you
play and talk together with.

00:27:21.770 --> 00:27:23.490
You help them, they help you.

00:27:24.280 --> 00:27:25.970
It refers to an equal relationship.

00:27:26.660 --> 00:27:27.870
"Friends"...

00:27:29.230 --> 00:27:31.230
We're friends now, aren't we?

00:27:38.770 --> 00:27:44.160
Well then, I permit
you all to be my friends.

00:27:45.640 --> 00:27:47.880
Diancie really is princess-y.

00:27:50.620 --> 00:27:52.330
But that's wonderful, Diancie.

00:27:53.090 --> 00:27:55.470
Friends... I am so happy.

00:28:01.620 --> 00:28:02.620
Is this...?

00:28:02.900 --> 00:28:03.857
It's a diamond!

00:28:03.881 --> 00:28:05.110
That is incredible!

00:28:05.380 --> 00:28:06.390
So pretty!

00:28:06.700 --> 00:28:09.310
However, it will disappear before too long.

00:28:09.750 --> 00:28:10.750
It will?

00:28:11.220 --> 00:28:13.300
Even if it does disappear,
could you let me have it?

00:28:13.870 --> 00:28:16.580
I will give it to you, Eureka.

00:28:16.820 --> 00:28:18.550
Yay! All right!

00:28:26.870 --> 00:28:28.740
Thank you, Diancie.

00:28:39.350 --> 00:28:42.110
Whose castle might this be?

00:28:42.750 --> 00:28:44.140
Hm? It's not a castle.

00:28:44.540 --> 00:28:45.730
It's a shopping mall.

00:28:46.130 --> 00:28:47.610
It's a place to go shopping.

00:28:48.790 --> 00:28:51.060
What is "shopping"?

00:28:51.570 --> 00:28:52.830
You've never done it?

00:28:53.210 --> 00:28:53.570
No.

00:28:54.040 --> 00:28:56.050
How about giving it a try then, Diancie?

00:28:56.730 --> 00:28:59.270
Forget about Xerneas for just a little bit.

00:29:01.020 --> 00:29:02.020
Very well then.

00:29:02.570 --> 00:29:04.170
I shall permit shopping.

00:29:04.760 --> 00:29:06.480
There she goes, giving us permission again.

00:29:08.610 --> 00:29:09.660
Diancie, let's go!

00:29:10.620 --> 00:29:11.620
Wait up!

00:29:12.010 --> 00:29:13.056
There they go.

00:29:13.080 --> 00:29:14.820
Girls will be girls.

00:29:20.120 --> 00:29:21.420
How cute!

00:29:23.300 --> 00:29:24.450
What is this?

00:29:24.780 --> 00:29:25.846
There's a hat, too!

00:29:25.870 --> 00:29:26.870
Shoes as well.

00:29:27.240 --> 00:29:28.240
Ta-da!

00:29:57.590 --> 00:29:59.470
You really look like a princess!

00:30:00.090 --> 00:30:01.090
Right?
Yeah.

00:30:06.310 --> 00:30:07.310
Diancie?

00:30:07.420 --> 00:30:08.420
What's wrong?

00:30:14.130 --> 00:30:15.810
Hey! Bro!

00:30:16.510 --> 00:30:18.010
Are you done shopping?

00:30:18.650 --> 00:30:19.926
We're still in the middle of it.

00:30:19.950 --> 00:30:21.480
What? You're still at it?

00:30:21.700 --> 00:30:23.780
We just wanna look at a
few more before we decide.

00:30:31.430 --> 00:30:32.430
Diancie?

00:30:34.650 --> 00:30:36.340
I have been caught.

00:30:36.630 --> 00:30:37.630
Eh?

00:30:54.420 --> 00:30:54.840
Here.

00:30:55.180 --> 00:30:56.260
Nice recovery.

00:31:08.610 --> 00:31:09.610
Where'd they go?

00:31:11.390 --> 00:31:12.570
Oh, there they are!

00:31:16.340 --> 00:31:18.230
What are those Pokémon?

00:31:18.660 --> 00:31:19.860
Do they work with the bandits?

00:31:21.190 --> 00:31:22.190
We have to help!

00:31:22.450 --> 00:31:23.820
Leave it to me!

00:31:24.260 --> 00:31:26.380
It is time for science
to open up the future!

00:31:26.850 --> 00:31:28.300
Citronic Gear, on!

00:31:37.880 --> 00:31:40.200
It is the Super Stretch Ladder DX!

00:31:40.540 --> 00:31:41.966
Satoshi, get on!

00:31:41.990 --> 00:31:42.990
All right!

00:31:44.420 --> 00:31:45.420
Here we go!
Yeah!

00:31:55.320 --> 00:31:58.240
Technology is incredible!

00:32:06.440 --> 00:32:07.267
Okay!

00:32:07.291 --> 00:32:09.080
Luchabull, I choose you!

00:32:21.380 --> 00:32:22.380
Diancie!

00:32:23.980 --> 00:32:24.980
Jump!

00:32:45.080 --> 00:32:46.250
What were those Pokémon?

00:32:46.700 --> 00:32:48.620
Those were the Jewel Pokémon Melecie.

00:32:49.470 --> 00:32:52.050
It's rare for them to show up
in the middle of a city like this.

00:32:52.450 --> 00:32:54.710
They have finally found me.

00:32:55.060 --> 00:32:57.060
Then they really were
the bandits' underlings?

00:32:57.350 --> 00:32:58.350
Well...

00:33:00.310 --> 00:33:01.390
Diancie...

00:33:02.010 --> 00:33:04.310
Did you have fun
shopping for the first time?

00:33:05.290 --> 00:33:06.610
You're the bandit from back then!

00:33:08.460 --> 00:33:10.650
Come on, get over here.

00:33:10.950 --> 00:33:12.070
I will not!

00:33:12.260 --> 00:33:13.500
Then I have no choice.

00:33:14.190 --> 00:33:15.190
Mafoxy!

00:33:17.300 --> 00:33:19.410
Leave this to me! You guys get out of here!

00:33:21.590 --> 00:33:22.590
Go!

00:33:23.060 --> 00:33:24.340
Where do you think you're going?

00:33:24.410 --> 00:33:25.690
Keromatsu, I choose you!

00:33:29.460 --> 00:33:32.276
Keromatsu, Water Pulse!
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:33:32.300 --> 00:33:33.980
Get out of my way! Flamethrower!

00:33:44.410 --> 00:33:47.050
Those are some good Pokémon.
I can't bring myself to dislike them.

00:34:00.570 --> 00:34:02.160
Please, help us out.

00:34:04.170 --> 00:34:05.170
Everyone, get on!

00:34:06.510 --> 00:34:07.580
Sihorn, go!

00:34:23.310 --> 00:34:24.390
Go!

00:34:30.740 --> 00:34:32.130
Thank you, Sihorn.

00:34:32.920 --> 00:34:33.920
You were a big help.

00:34:34.910 --> 00:34:35.910
Bye bye!

00:34:40.350 --> 00:34:42.190
Will Satoshi be all right?

00:34:42.520 --> 00:34:44.206
Satoshi's going to be fine, count on it!

00:34:44.230 --> 00:34:44.540
Yeah.

00:34:45.190 --> 00:34:48.530
This is entirely because of me.
I am causing everybody trouble.

00:34:50.930 --> 00:34:53.536
Of course we help our friends when
they are in trouble, that is a given!

00:34:53.560 --> 00:34:55.670
I was going to say that!

00:34:57.050 --> 00:34:58.050
Everyone...

00:35:05.460 --> 00:35:06.540
What was that?

00:35:07.250 --> 00:35:08.250
Diancie!

00:35:09.550 --> 00:35:11.220
I am fine.

00:35:12.650 --> 00:35:13.650
Diancie!
No! Diancie!
No!

00:35:21.540 --> 00:35:23.430
Dedenne, Nuzzle!

00:35:28.430 --> 00:35:29.430
Now!

00:35:38.740 --> 00:35:41.150
I'm pleased! I'm truly pleased!

00:35:41.670 --> 00:35:46.300
To think you would oppose my
Gekkouga using such a primitive method.

00:35:47.260 --> 00:35:49.520
I've taken a liking to your bunch.

00:35:49.750 --> 00:35:51.716
Again! It's one after another!

00:35:51.740 --> 00:35:52.940
You're pesky!

00:35:54.230 --> 00:35:56.230
Gekkouga, Double Team!

00:36:00.340 --> 00:36:01.900
Harimaron, help us out!

00:36:06.890 --> 00:36:07.890
Fokko, you too!

00:36:10.780 --> 00:36:12.310
Harimaron, Pin Missile!

00:36:12.630 --> 00:36:14.020
Fokko, Flamethrower!

00:36:17.730 --> 00:36:18.730
Water Shuriken!

00:36:27.650 --> 00:36:28.890
Satoshi!
I am glad you are safe!

00:36:32.500 --> 00:36:33.640
Run away, Diancie!

00:36:34.070 --> 00:36:35.070
I will!

00:36:43.530 --> 00:36:44.530
Princess!

00:36:47.310 --> 00:36:47.890
Majima!

00:36:48.110 --> 00:36:50.850
Diancie-sama, we will protect you.

00:36:51.800 --> 00:36:52.800
You...!

00:36:53.880 --> 00:36:55.070
The Melecie from before!

00:36:57.190 --> 00:36:58.190
Don't get in my way!

00:36:58.370 --> 00:36:59.370
Attack!

00:37:04.070 --> 00:37:05.070
Princess!

00:37:12.890 --> 00:37:14.630
A Sacred Diamond!

00:37:25.190 --> 00:37:26.190
Diancie!

00:37:31.170 --> 00:37:32.340
Princess!

00:37:34.440 --> 00:37:36.690
Brigarron, use Pin Missile once more!

00:37:42.650 --> 00:37:43.270
Who's that?

00:37:43.670 --> 00:37:47.800
She is the woman who rescued
me from the Rocket Gang's place.

00:37:48.340 --> 00:37:49.470
Then she's on our side?

00:37:49.950 --> 00:37:52.350
Diancie, better get moving!

00:37:53.260 --> 00:37:54.716
Princess, this way!

00:37:54.740 --> 00:37:56.810
Yes. Pardon me.

00:38:00.130 --> 00:38:01.180
Miriss Steel.

00:38:02.360 --> 00:38:03.860
If you're here...

00:38:04.830 --> 00:38:06.670
then I take it Algus is here too?

00:38:09.080 --> 00:38:10.430
I wonder.

00:38:14.090 --> 00:38:17.960
We serve to protect Diancie-sama.

00:38:19.800 --> 00:38:21.720
So you're the princess' bodyguards?

00:38:22.110 --> 00:38:24.980
So Diancie was a real princess all along.

00:38:25.210 --> 00:38:26.900
Who are these people?

00:38:27.320 --> 00:38:28.320
We're...

00:38:28.670 --> 00:38:29.670
My...

00:38:30.090 --> 00:38:31.090
friends.

00:38:39.810 --> 00:38:41.350
Hup.

00:38:42.950 --> 00:38:46.070
We have been traveling for several months.

00:38:46.540 --> 00:38:47.860
To search for Xerneas?

00:38:48.340 --> 00:38:49.340
Yes.

00:39:08.860 --> 00:39:10.510
I feel the Fairy Aura.

00:39:23.110 --> 00:39:28.410
We constantly moved to new locations,
but we were never able to meet Xerneas.

00:39:37.210 --> 00:39:39.950
One day, I saw a city far in the distance.

00:39:43.500 --> 00:39:46.170
I wanted to go see it.

00:39:47.180 --> 00:39:49.660
Somehow, it seemed as if it would be fun.

00:39:51.860 --> 00:39:53.850
And that's when you met us?

00:39:54.330 --> 00:40:00.270
Diancie-sama might have felt
confined after being with us all this time.

00:40:01.100 --> 00:40:03.260
I am sorry for acting according
to my own convenience.

00:40:03.740 --> 00:40:06.820
Please, do not do
something like this again.

00:40:07.260 --> 00:40:08.260
I will not.

00:40:21.160 --> 00:40:22.160
What's this?

00:40:22.570 --> 00:40:25.830
It is one of our countries, which
can found all throughout the world.

00:40:26.520 --> 00:40:31.250
All these countries are connected
through these diamond paths.

00:40:37.510 --> 00:40:39.550
Thank you for coming out to greet me.

00:40:53.090 --> 00:40:54.570
What is this?

00:40:56.150 --> 00:40:57.210
Princess.

00:40:58.690 --> 00:40:59.690
Di!

00:41:01.800 --> 00:41:06.120
The Sacred Diamond has
finally expended its lifespan.

00:41:06.620 --> 00:41:07.620
What are you saying?

00:41:26.910 --> 00:41:28.370
No...

00:41:29.490 --> 00:41:33.030
I have come all this
way to let you know that.

00:41:34.490 --> 00:41:35.960
What's the Sacred Diamond?

00:41:36.210 --> 00:41:37.210
Tell us!

00:41:37.370 --> 00:41:39.900
We'll do anything we can to help.

00:41:41.300 --> 00:41:42.300
Yes!

00:41:42.440 --> 00:41:43.460
Everybody...

00:41:46.200 --> 00:41:53.030
The Sacred Diamond is the source of the energy glow
that is sent throughout our countries around the world.

00:41:53.650 --> 00:41:56.050
It has vanished.

00:42:05.450 --> 00:42:09.340
Only Diancie-sama is able
to forge a Sacred Diamond.

00:42:09.890 --> 00:42:13.700
But I still do not have that power.

00:42:14.270 --> 00:42:20.230
Xerneas' Fairy Aura is sure
to awaken your true power.

00:42:21.140 --> 00:42:22.580
So that's how it is.

00:42:27.410 --> 00:42:30.046
I had no idea about the
state the country was in.

00:42:30.070 --> 00:42:31.250
I...

00:42:31.820 --> 00:42:35.990
I have no right to be called a princess.

00:42:39.700 --> 00:42:41.060
Don't cry, Diancie.

00:42:43.460 --> 00:42:45.290
Crying never solves anything.

00:43:00.380 --> 00:43:01.380
Princess.

00:43:03.930 --> 00:43:05.460
It is as you say.

00:43:05.900 --> 00:43:07.400
This is no time to be crying.

00:43:08.170 --> 00:43:10.450
Let us go, to meet with Xerneas.

00:43:10.870 --> 00:43:11.870
That's the spirit.

00:43:13.260 --> 00:43:14.600
Princess.

00:43:35.610 --> 00:43:36.650
Diancie-sama!

00:43:57.070 --> 00:43:58.070
Wow!

00:43:58.770 --> 00:44:01.900
I feel a strong Fairy Aura
from the forest over there.

00:44:02.430 --> 00:44:03.916
Then, Xerneas is...?

00:44:03.940 --> 00:44:04.940
Right there!

00:44:06.510 --> 00:44:07.510
Princess.

00:44:07.850 --> 00:44:09.990
Those are the Alearth Woods.

00:44:11.350 --> 00:44:12.690
The Alearth Woods?

00:44:13.000 --> 00:44:19.620
Long ago, the Alearth Woods gave rise to the
Great Destruction, which would wipe out all life.

00:44:23.820 --> 00:44:29.290
Since then, it has become forbidden
land that nobody must set foot in.

00:44:29.930 --> 00:44:33.580
There is also something
else I must tell you.

00:44:34.690 --> 00:44:37.340
It is about the cause
of the Great Destruction.

00:44:38.630 --> 00:44:43.090
The Great Destruction was caused by
Yveltal, the embodiment of Destruction.

00:44:44.680 --> 00:44:49.420
After destroying everything,
Yveltal turned into a cocoon.

00:44:51.500 --> 00:44:56.230
Alearth became forbidden land
because that cocoon resides there.

00:44:56.670 --> 00:44:57.670
"Yveltal"?

00:44:57.780 --> 00:45:01.950
If I remember right, it is a legendary
Pokémon said to be able to take away all life.

00:45:05.100 --> 00:45:07.210
According to legend,

00:45:07.960 --> 00:45:13.530
those who disturb the sleep of the Cocoon of
Destruction shall receive judgment of fury!

00:45:14.030 --> 00:45:15.030
Huh?

00:45:31.210 --> 00:45:32.710
These are the Alearth Woods?

00:45:33.240 --> 00:45:35.940
It is hard to believe the Great
Destruction happened here.

00:45:36.450 --> 00:45:40.770
The ruined forest revived over the
many years that passed since then.

00:45:45.550 --> 00:45:52.750
It is said that Yveltal caused the Great Destruction in
order to bring out the forest's ability to regenerate.

00:45:54.860 --> 00:45:58.950
So you are saying that even the Great Destruction
might just be another part of the law of nature...

00:45:59.420 --> 00:46:00.770
The law of nature?

00:46:01.450 --> 00:46:06.170
The birth of new life, death... that kind of
"rules", so to speak, the natural world follows.

00:46:10.690 --> 00:46:13.960
Isn't this considered forbidden land?

00:46:14.220 --> 00:46:17.386
But Diancie is inside this forest.

00:46:17.410 --> 00:46:19.970
We can't give up after coming this far.

00:46:20.340 --> 00:46:21.340
Nay!

00:46:42.410 --> 00:46:43.410
Xerneas!

00:46:43.550 --> 00:46:44.550
You mean that?

00:47:02.770 --> 00:47:04.980
Xerneas, please wait!

00:47:32.690 --> 00:47:33.690
Xerneas.

00:47:36.220 --> 00:47:39.270
You have pursued me
all this time, haven't you?

00:47:40.380 --> 00:47:42.300
I have finally been able to meet you.

00:47:43.630 --> 00:47:46.210
I know what it is...

00:47:46.950 --> 00:47:48.980
that you are seeking.

00:47:49.530 --> 00:47:49.990
Eh?

00:47:50.430 --> 00:47:51.790
I shall bestow it upon you.

00:48:00.730 --> 00:48:01.790
It's the Fairy Aura!

00:48:13.850 --> 00:48:18.730
It is you yourself that
will have to foster life.

00:48:33.540 --> 00:48:36.130
Xerneas, you have my gratitude.

00:48:36.840 --> 00:48:37.950
Diancie-sama!

00:48:38.230 --> 00:48:39.340
Princess!

00:48:39.950 --> 00:48:42.410
I felt the Fairy Aura too!

00:48:43.240 --> 00:48:45.450
I kinda feel like I was given strength too!

00:48:47.610 --> 00:48:49.800
Now you can definitely save your country!

00:48:50.270 --> 00:48:54.220
So have I become able to forge
a Sacred Diamond, I wonder?

00:48:54.850 --> 00:48:55.717
Try it out!

00:48:55.741 --> 00:48:56.910
I'm sure you can do it!

00:48:57.340 --> 00:48:58.340
Princess!

00:49:14.450 --> 00:49:15.870
Congratulations, Diancie!

00:49:16.330 --> 00:49:19.490
Now you're finally able to
make real diamonds, right?

00:49:20.070 --> 00:49:21.070
You are...

00:49:21.290 --> 00:49:23.050
You're the one who
helped us the other day?!

00:49:24.220 --> 00:49:26.760
We will be taking Diancie!

00:49:33.100 --> 00:49:34.100
What's this about?

00:49:34.330 --> 00:49:35.340
We knew all along.

00:49:35.940 --> 00:49:42.470
The reason you were trying to meet Xerneas was because
Diancie still didn't have the power to make real diamonds.

00:49:43.810 --> 00:49:44.810
Thanks for helping.

00:49:46.730 --> 00:49:53.090
A Diancie that can't create diamonds is
as pointless as a chocolate without cocoa.

00:49:53.870 --> 00:49:55.150
Algus Steel.

00:49:55.330 --> 00:49:56.950
The big-shot bandit...

00:49:57.350 --> 00:49:58.990
And that's his daughter Miriss.

00:49:59.290 --> 00:50:03.060
It was quite hard, you know? Watching
over you to keep others from interfering.

00:50:03.340 --> 00:50:04.660
Okay, Vine Whip!

00:50:21.070 --> 00:50:22.930
I'll be taking Diancie!

00:50:24.550 --> 00:50:25.710
Hitotsuki, after them!

00:50:27.850 --> 00:50:28.850
Brigarron!

00:50:29.340 --> 00:50:30.340
Diancie!

00:50:31.130 --> 00:50:32.520
We must save the princess!

00:50:43.730 --> 00:50:47.106
If you want diamonds, I shall give
them to you! So please, let me go!

00:50:47.130 --> 00:50:49.980
I have to hurry back to my country!

00:51:16.660 --> 00:51:18.110
Thanks for your excellent work.

00:51:18.700 --> 00:51:19.700
Marilyn!

00:51:21.500 --> 00:51:23.810
You look fantastic even
when you're angry, Riot!

00:51:24.360 --> 00:51:25.480
Later!

00:51:40.110 --> 00:51:41.110
Hold it!

00:51:42.290 --> 00:51:44.180
Here! This way, Diancie!

00:51:45.740 --> 00:51:47.420
Diancie!

00:51:57.550 --> 00:51:58.550
You brat!
Excuse me!

00:52:03.470 --> 00:52:04.040
Why?

00:52:04.360 --> 00:52:05.490
No, I just sort of...

00:52:13.350 --> 00:52:14.350
What is this?

00:52:14.440 --> 00:52:15.440
I don't know.

00:52:19.030 --> 00:52:20.686
Hand over Diancie!

00:52:20.710 --> 00:52:21.790
No way!

00:52:22.930 --> 00:52:24.520
When adults talk, you listen!

00:52:25.310 --> 00:52:26.330
There's too many of them.

00:52:26.550 --> 00:52:27.550
What do we do?

00:52:27.640 --> 00:52:29.590
It's impossible for us to get in there.

00:52:54.530 --> 00:52:55.530
Oh no!

00:52:55.850 --> 00:52:58.150
Diancie-sama! Satoshi, my boy!

00:52:58.600 --> 00:52:59.880
Get out of there!

00:53:30.850 --> 00:53:32.520
The Cocoon of... Destruction!

00:53:52.330 --> 00:53:55.140
"Those who disturb the sleep
of the Cocoon of Destruction...

00:53:55.770 --> 00:53:57.900
shall receive judgment of fury!"

00:53:58.730 --> 00:53:59.730
That's...?

00:54:00.290 --> 00:54:01.290
Yveltal.

00:55:24.040 --> 00:55:25.650
Princess!

00:55:27.800 --> 00:55:28.800
Gotcha!

00:55:30.140 --> 00:55:31.200
Diancie!

00:56:15.070 --> 00:56:16.590
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:56:28.030 --> 00:56:29.350
Diancie, are you all right?

00:56:30.190 --> 00:56:31.190
Yes!

00:56:32.520 --> 00:56:34.626
We're getting out of this
dangerous forest right now!

00:56:34.650 --> 00:56:35.906
Never mind the diamonds.

00:56:35.930 --> 00:56:37.870
Our lives are more important!

00:56:58.770 --> 00:57:00.810
What is that Pokémon?

00:57:01.480 --> 00:57:02.950
My Mafoxy has been...

00:57:05.770 --> 00:57:06.770
Riot?

00:57:06.910 --> 00:57:07.910
It's no good.

00:57:08.340 --> 00:57:09.340
Eh?

00:57:10.570 --> 00:57:12.050
Let's give up on Diancie.

00:57:22.750 --> 00:57:23.750
Watch out!

00:57:47.700 --> 00:57:49.270
I can't believe this is happening.

00:57:49.620 --> 00:57:51.266
The forest will vanish once again.

00:57:51.290 --> 00:57:53.210
Hey, everyone!

00:57:56.630 --> 00:57:57.626
Princess!

00:57:57.650 --> 00:57:58.650
You're all right!

00:57:58.930 --> 00:58:00.340
Luchabull, thanks a lot.

00:58:18.390 --> 00:58:20.346
It's warding off Yveltal's power!

00:58:20.370 --> 00:58:21.750
That means she's finally...

00:58:29.650 --> 00:58:30.650
Princess!

00:58:38.070 --> 00:58:41.140
I still do not have the power...

00:58:46.690 --> 00:58:47.690
Diancie!

00:59:05.910 --> 00:59:07.290
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:59:16.470 --> 00:59:19.410
My dear Satoshi,
Diancie-sama must be protec...

00:59:21.640 --> 00:59:22.640
Majima.

00:59:40.930 --> 00:59:41.930
Pikachu!

00:59:42.470 --> 00:59:43.590
Hang in there!

00:59:57.860 --> 01:00:00.200
I need to protect everybody...

01:00:00.770 --> 01:00:01.770
And yet I...

01:00:02.210 --> 01:00:03.450
cannot do anything.

01:00:05.190 --> 01:00:06.340
Don't give up!

01:00:07.670 --> 01:00:09.680
It's only when you
give up that it's all over!

01:00:09.930 --> 01:00:10.590
He is right!

01:00:10.830 --> 01:00:12.366
You can't give up!

01:00:12.390 --> 01:00:13.610
Hang in there!

01:00:18.090 --> 01:00:19.480
Pikachu, are you all right?

01:00:27.190 --> 01:00:28.190
Okay...

01:00:43.740 --> 01:00:44.740
Thunderbolt!

01:01:09.050 --> 01:01:10.990
It is you yourself...

01:01:12.280 --> 01:01:14.450
that will have to foster life.

01:01:15.820 --> 01:01:17.950
I will not give up.

01:01:45.610 --> 01:01:46.700
A Mega Evolution!

01:02:16.030 --> 01:02:17.030
Wow!

01:02:17.070 --> 01:02:18.070
You did it!

01:02:18.170 --> 01:02:20.400
This is a Sacred Diamond!

01:02:48.380 --> 01:02:49.380
Little boy and Pikachu...

01:02:49.940 --> 01:02:51.530
Thanks for helping us out back there.

01:02:52.030 --> 01:02:53.090
We'll return the favor.

01:03:11.470 --> 01:03:12.470
Yeah!
We got it!

01:03:26.500 --> 01:03:27.500
Miriss!
Dad!

01:04:02.490 --> 01:04:03.490
Xerneas.

01:05:10.380 --> 01:05:11.380
It left.

01:05:11.540 --> 01:05:12.820
We are safe.

01:05:18.260 --> 01:05:19.260
Pikachu.
Huh?

01:05:19.860 --> 01:05:20.980
Pikachu, what's wrong?

01:05:27.330 --> 01:05:28.330
Back then...

01:05:42.990 --> 01:05:43.990
Pikachu!

01:05:45.010 --> 01:05:46.740
What's wrong? Hey!

01:05:47.270 --> 01:05:48.270
Pikachu!

01:05:48.540 --> 01:05:49.540
Pikachu!

01:05:49.640 --> 01:05:51.060
Answer me, Pikachu!

01:05:56.270 --> 01:05:57.270
Pikachu...

01:05:58.540 --> 01:05:59.720
Pikachu!

01:06:15.020 --> 01:06:16.020
Xerneas...

01:06:31.930 --> 01:06:32.930
Pikachu!

01:06:43.250 --> 01:06:44.250
Princess!

01:06:44.530 --> 01:06:45.530
Majima!

01:06:45.660 --> 01:06:46.660
Everybody!

01:06:48.030 --> 01:06:51.380
Xerneas has granted you life.

01:07:13.300 --> 01:07:14.490
It is turning into a tree.

01:07:15.290 --> 01:07:16.320
Xerneas...

01:07:17.090 --> 01:07:19.770
has chosen to sleep here on this land...

01:07:20.590 --> 01:07:22.730
in order to protect the law of nature.

01:07:25.810 --> 01:07:26.840
It's dying?

01:07:27.090 --> 01:07:28.090
No way...

01:07:32.950 --> 01:07:34.980
Do not be sad.

01:07:35.810 --> 01:07:37.450
Xerneas is talking!

01:07:38.450 --> 01:07:39.450
What is it saying?

01:07:39.820 --> 01:07:42.360
This is not a death.

01:07:43.490 --> 01:07:45.460
This is a sign of birth.
This is a sign of birth.

01:07:46.670 --> 01:07:47.670
And... And...

01:07:48.090 --> 01:07:50.130
the beginning of
hope... the beginning of hope.

01:07:52.260 --> 01:07:53.260
Birth...

01:07:53.570 --> 01:07:55.560
and the beginning of hope...

01:08:06.850 --> 01:08:07.850
I see.

01:08:09.320 --> 01:08:11.150
Thank you, Xerneas.

01:09:00.760 --> 01:09:02.026
It's so pretty.

01:09:02.050 --> 01:09:03.536
Yeah, it's like...

01:09:03.560 --> 01:09:05.260
we've been reborn.

01:09:05.960 --> 01:09:07.850
Somehow, this feels...

01:09:08.450 --> 01:09:10.740
really good.

01:09:45.300 --> 01:09:46.420
Princess!

01:09:46.660 --> 01:09:47.780
Well done!

01:10:04.060 --> 01:10:08.020
Satoshi, Pikachu, Serena, Eureka, Citron...

01:10:08.730 --> 01:10:11.480
Everybody, thank you oh so very much.

01:10:12.180 --> 01:10:13.700
I'm glad to have met you, Diancie.

01:10:15.170 --> 01:10:16.426
Me too.

01:10:16.450 --> 01:10:17.450
Eureka too!

01:10:17.650 --> 01:10:19.980
We are friends forever.

01:10:20.340 --> 01:10:21.340
Yeah.

01:10:24.910 --> 01:10:25.910
Huh?

01:10:27.380 --> 01:10:28.380
This diamond!

01:10:28.630 --> 01:10:30.230
It stayed without disappearing!

01:10:30.500 --> 01:10:31.500
Huh?

01:10:31.610 --> 01:10:34.910
Then that's the first
diamond that Diancie made?

01:10:35.310 --> 01:10:35.560
Ah...

01:10:36.090 --> 01:10:37.750
It's a proof of our friendship!

01:10:41.720 --> 01:10:42.720
Yes!

01:10:43.190 --> 01:10:45.400
Diancie, you keep this.

01:10:48.470 --> 01:10:49.820
I shall treasure it!

01:10:50.290 --> 01:10:51.290
Yeah.
Yeah.
